20:51-20:59: 29690 console + op-log lines "StopDec / ExtDrive FAILED ret=0x800000D3" -- GetAuthorityFailed: Common Motion Utility (reopened
after the 20:02 crash) held the card, every engine stop failed, and a failed stop is a forced line (never dropped by the 30 / 500 budget)
that is also op-logged each time. EtherCAT/Pci1203MotorRoute.cpp: the same station / axis / call / verdict / reason within 5 s is counted
